{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>「40億千金」蔡頌思（Jocelyn）因在2020年參選港姐而為人熟識，家境富裕、背景顯赫的她，爺爺是已故「海產大王」蔡繼有，爸爸是新華集團主席及香港中華總商會永遠名譽會長蔡冠深。去年3月蔡頌思與日籍金融才俊老公Mikie在五星級酒店舉行盛大婚禮，出席的賓客相當有份量，特首李家超都有到場祝賀。日前，香港中文大學（中大）聯合書院「蔡繼有宿舍（Choi Kai Yau Residence）」舉行開幕典禮，蔡頌思與父母蔡冠深及蔡關頴琴一同出席揭幕儀式。身為中大聯合書院舊生的蔡頌思，在社交平台大爆當年「起Hall」背後的搞笑內幕，大爆這座新宿舍正是自己當年向父親「提議」的成果！</p><figure><img alt=\"「40億千金」蔡頌思（Jocelyn）。（IG@jocelynchoizs）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260917/1177288908845617152379652.jpeg/GPElYR6gFBi1URt1-SUcLCGBDSZBXgslEjOV4RIzleE\"/><figcaption>「40億千金」蔡頌思（Jocelyn）。（IG@jocelynchoizs）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"出身顯赫豪門。（IG@jocelynchoizs）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197255281344909312382169.jpeg/jcb4m-MPDdLmqUA0_3JZTg9xtc6bOYBYYx_tW2Mf7Vs\"/><figcaption>出身顯赫豪門。（IG@jocelynchoizs）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔡頌思與日籍丈夫在越南舉行奢華婚禮。（IG@jocelynchoizs）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250410/987052019175002112743651.jpeg/mya4LnKcaN8I8EZUDAj4D1NhDU3nn-MZr7OUXK-zlFw\"/><figcaption>蔡頌思與日籍丈夫在越南舉行奢華婚禮。（IG@jocelynchoizs）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大曬好身材。（IG@jocelynchoizs）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197255273564082176162905.jpeg/fb8WoiJ_SFu46TbSCVXupwT0XBDd9yXqVbFG9FWxRvQ\"/><figcaption>大曬好身材。（IG@jocelynchoizs）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"出席保良局周年慈善晚會。（IG@jocelynchoizs）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197255278299713536276980.jpeg/olyJNeQBgF3FyBa5P0x7hyUCU4oSsYfdu0AMErtADBI\"/><figcaption>出席保良局周年慈善晚會。（IG@jocelynchoizs）</figcaption></figure><p>蔡頌思出席「蔡繼有宿舍」開幕典禮　揭內幕：蔡宿真係我話要起㗎</p><p>蔡頌思在社交平台分享當日的盛況，她寫道：「Another milestone for the family legacy 🥳（家族傳承的又一里程碑）」身穿黑白波點復古短裙的她，在新落成的「蔡繼有宿舍」門前及爺爺蔡繼有的肖像畫前開心打卡，更拍片記錄爸爸蔡冠深在台上致辭的畫面，蔡頌思寫道：「唔係講笑，蔡宿真係我話要起㗎😂因為讀U為咗住Hall太辛苦，我返到屋企提議不如起返個Hall😂」原來當年身為學生的她，深明大學生宿位緊張與「爭Hall住」的辛酸，回家向父親「提議」，蔡氏家族便慷慨捐資推動宿舍興建。身為師姐的蔡頌思更在新宿舍中庭打卡，向學弟妹喊話：「聯合師弟妹，你哋真係太幸福啦，快啲多謝師姐我啦😆🤪」</p><figure><img alt=\"蔡頌思出席「蔡繼有宿舍」開幕典禮。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197254184496533504523089.png/jXJDlIpR4CTTV6r0S7RMgRwx8wbuBSgY2W7WFdlu1hU\"/><figcaption>蔡頌思出席「蔡繼有宿舍」開幕典禮。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"中大蔡繼有宿舍。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197254182231478272579264.png/dvG1_oGjpnzi7fmi0c0F6w1wIJ1XZ4KuiK1tnYitbZ0\"/><figcaption>中大蔡繼有宿舍。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"中大蔡繼有宿舍。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197254179739930624918450.png/COtSKV_jiTMLs1sUIbPudTpxKDpx3QlHRvP-MEbz_jA\"/><figcaption>中大蔡繼有宿舍。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"在爺爺蔡繼有的肖像畫前開心打卡。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197254072647290880219638.png/85N2ZcgGNgLAvpZjn9hTgTLtDTH_0x_lRt7pNUbe6TU\"/><figcaption>在爺爺蔡繼有的肖像畫前開心打卡。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔡頌思大爆因當年爭宿位太辛苦，返屋企提議起hall：真係我話要起㗎。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197254070407401472203456.png/2yqYNiS5FoewTknzfqBQaVc_oF2jWMjdyOWqZ8jlqmc\"/><figcaption>蔡頌思大爆因當年爭宿位太辛苦，返屋企提議起hall：真係我話要起㗎。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大爆料！（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197254067995545600015374.png/bNAcL8uypygnxOfgCu_7k3t9SE2HdlJvKrO96yqzves\"/><figcaption>大爆料！（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>以家族之名命名　大讚爸爸愛妻舉動：Concert hall named after my mom</p><p>除了以爺爺蔡繼有命名的學生宿舍之外，亦設有「蔡冠深文化中心」及「蔡關頴琴展藝廳」，一家人在「蔡冠深文化中心」門前大合照，蔡頌思更曬出「蔡關頴琴展藝廳（Janice WK Choi Concert Hall）」的門牌照，調侃爸爸的愛妻舉動：「我爸爸到底有幾愛妻？Concert hall named after my mom」。網民紛紛留言笑稱：「真正嘅有錢任性」、「貧窮限制咗我嘅想像」！</p><figure><img alt=\"一家人合照。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197254065793404928603752.jpeg/GCmoQFsylIbMe286nEuYZFYFt8sr0pzfRdOYgkXTmII\"/><figcaption>一家人合照。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"揭爸爸愛妻舉動。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197254063427686400870194.png/g3pZmqdxBnVjLQ6Q3S_dwXlOp6v7xu9SzGrbZcxq22U\"/><figcaption>揭爸爸愛妻舉動。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T03:03:53.629135+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1182,"images":13,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T02:00:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T03:08:05.694112+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T02:57:22.987621+00:00","content_hash":"90b17a71350c5c27bb77f453465fcb0173dc088beae52fb8a5a2dce9993cb06c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}